+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| SPEC | 470 | 25 | 25 | 32 |
+| IMPL | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 |
+| ENV | 9 | 9 | 9 | 9 |
+| TEST | 66 | 9 | 9 | 9 |
+| BOTH | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
+| SPEC_PARTIAL | প্রযোজ্য নয় | 7 | 0 | 0 |
+| IMPL_PARTIAL | প্রযোজ্য নয় | 0 | 0 | 0 |
+| UNDECIDABLE | 28 | 22 | 29 | 22 |
+| মোট | 574 | 73 | 73 | 73 |
+
